$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM N-{3-[{3-[(1,4-Dioxido-1,2,4-benzotriazin-3-yl)amino]propyl}(methyl)amino]propyl}-1-phenazinecarboxamide
(8). To a solution of trifluoroacetamide 20 (283 mg, 0.7 mmol) in MeOH
(10 mL) was added aqueous NH3 (6 mL) and reaction mixture was stirred at
20 °C for 18 h. The solvent was evaporated and the residue was dissolved
in DMF (5 mL). 1-(1H-Imidazol-1-ylcarbonyl)phenazine (283 mg, 1.0 mmol),
prepared from 1-phenazinecarboxylic acid (23)32 and CDI, was added and
the mixture stirred at 20 °C for 48 h. The solvent was evaporated and the
residue was purified by chromatography, eluting with a gradient (0-1%) of
aqueous NH3/(0-3%) MeOH/DCM to give compound 8 (293 mg, 82%) as a red
solid: mp (DCM/hexane) 129-130 °C; 1H NMR δ 10.85, (br s, 1 H, NH), 8.93
(dd, J = 7.1, 1.4 Hz, 1 H, ArH), 8.52 (br s, 1 H, NH), 8.33 (dd, J = 8.7,
1.4 Hz, 1 H, ArH), 8.21-8.27 (m, 2 H, ArH), 8.11 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 1 H,
ArH), 7.93 (dd, J = 8.6, 6.5 Hz, 1 H, ArH), 7.86-7.90 (m, 3 H, ArH), 7.70
(t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1 H, ArH), 7.42 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1 H, ArH), 3.77 (q, J =
6.4 Hz, 2 H, CH2), 3.66 (q, J = 5.7 Hz, 2 H, CH2), 2.68 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2
H, CH2), 2.62 (t, J = 6.1 Hz, 2 H, CH2), 2.36 (s, 3 H, CH3), 2.10 (quin,
J = 7.1 Hz, 2 H, CH2), 1.89 (quin, J = 6.2 Hz, 2 H, CH2); 13C NMR δ
165.0, 149.8, 143.4, 142.9, 141.4, 140.8, 138.2, 135.4, 135.1, 135.0,
